lib-secret-manager (1.0.3-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Security & Performance:
    - Implemented lazy loading for secrets: passwords are decrypted only on demand,
      significantly reducing memory usage and startup time.
    - Fixed memory leak in SecretWorker (proper GValue unref).
    - Added automatic clipboard clearing 30 seconds after copying a password.
  * User Experience:
    - Removed "Password" column from the main table for better security and cleaner UI.
    - Added built-in secure password generator in the "Add Secret" dialog.
    - Replaced text "Copy" button with an icon inside the password field in details view.
    - Switched to DPasswordEdit for password inputs (eye icon visibility toggle).
    - Added real-time validation: "Save" button is disabled if required fields are empty.
  * Build System:
    - Improved CMake logic for embedding DTK translations.
    - Added detailed code documentation for production readiness.

 -- Dmitry Kh <admin@linuxaiworks.ru>  Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0800

